  "narrative_prose": "The Hub Hearth glowed with a fierce, blinding orange light as Ryn monitored the Magnetohydrodynamic Kelvin-Helmholtz shear across the ferrofluid sea. The deafening hiss of the steam vents mixed with the sharp smell of ozone and caramelized roots, while the oppressively hot air stung her skin and left a distinct static tang on her tongue. She moved quickly to DEFEND the delicate copper stockpot, adjusting the vents to ATTRACT the displaced heat, and yelled at the others to CONSUME their meal before the cold set in, before decisively handing the heavy brass baton directly to Silas."
